# Aktar-v0.2.0
- Bug fixed
- Each service opens in a new window
- Three services in Aktar: Serivce-C, Serivce-CDM, Serivce-DT
- 4 cameras are supported for streaming (Serivce-C)
- CDM on first camera (Service-CDM)
- CDM database reset after each run
- Visualize plane model (Service-DT)
- Person detection and recognition (Aktar-AI)
